Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:18.50,Label,,0,0,0,,PREVIZ  ·  Scene 1: Hook
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:04.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,Have you ever kept trying, even when nobody listened?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.77,0:00:08.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today's story is about a man who kept trying...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.11,0:00:10.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,for nine hundred and fifty years!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.46,0:00:17.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the story of Prophet Nuh, peace be upon him, and the great ark, from the Holy Quran.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.50,0:00:42.58,Label,,0,0,0,,PREVIZ  ·  Scene 2: The people forget Allah
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.50,0:00:25.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,Long, long ago, people lived in a beautiful land full of gardens and rivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.26,0:00:29.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,But they forgot Allah, the One who gave them everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.50,0:00:35.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,They made statues of stone, and named them Wadd, Suwa, Yaghuth, Yauq, and Nasr.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.49,0:00:41.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,They prayed to them, even though statues cannot see, hear, or help anyone.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:42.58,0:01:16.42,Label,,0,0,0,,PREVIZ  ·  Scene 3: Nuh's message
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.58,0:00:48.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,So Allah sent a kind and patient messenger from among them: Nuh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.39,0:00:51.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nuh said: O my people, worship Allah alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.61,0:00:55.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ask your Lord to forgive you, for He is always Forgiving.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.89,0:01:02.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,He will send you rain from the sky, and give you wealth, children, gardens, and rivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.42,0:01:04.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,He told them: Look at the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.67,0:01:08.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Allah made the moon a light, and the sun a shining lamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.88,0:01:14.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Look at the earth, spread out for you like a carpet, with wide paths to walk on.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.42,0:01:44.33,Label,,0,0,0,,PREVIZ  ·  Scene 4: They would not listen
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.42,0:01:20.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nuh called his people by night, and by day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.58,0:01:25.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,He spoke loudly to crowds, and quietly to people one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.00,0:01:32.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,But they put their fingers in their ears, and covered themselves with their clothes, so they would not hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.95,0:01:34.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Did Nuh give up?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.12,0:01:34.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.34,0:01:37.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,He kept trying for nine hundred and fifty years!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.88,0:01:40.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,And he never asked for money.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.01,0:01:42.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,He said: My reward is only from Allah.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.33,0:02:10.25,Label,,0,0,0,,PREVIZ  ·  Scene 5: Kindness to everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.33,0:01:47.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Only a few people believed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.39,0:01:49.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,Many of them were poor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.14,0:01:53.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,The proud chiefs laughed: Only the lowest of us follow you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.63,0:01:56.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,They wanted Nuh to send them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.22,0:02:00.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,But Nuh said: I will never drive away those who believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.49,0:02:03.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,To Allah, the best person is not the richest.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.91,0:02:06.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is the one with the best heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.50,0:02:08.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,So let's be kind to everyone!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.25,0:02:35.08,Label,,0,0,0,,PREVIZ  ·  Scene 6: Building the ark
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.25,0:02:20.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then Allah told Nuh that no more of his people would believe, and said: Build the ship, under Our eyes, and with Our guidance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.23,0:02:26.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,So Nuh built a huge ship of wooden planks and nails, on dry land, far from any sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.14,0:02:30.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every time the chiefs walked past, they made fun of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.13,0:02:33.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,But Nuh kept working, trusting Allah completely.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.08,0:03:01.08,Label,,0,0,0,,PREVIZ  ·  Scene 7: All aboard
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.08,0:02:40.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then Allah's command came, and water burst up from the earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.66,0:02:50.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,Allah said: Carry in the ship a pair of every kind of animal, your family, except those who refused to believe, and the believers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.42,0:02:52.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,And Nuh said: Climb aboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.45,0:02:54.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,Bismillahi majraha wa mursaha.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.70,0:02:59.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the name of Allah it sails, and in the name of Allah it stops.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:01.08,0:03:39.00,Label,,0,0,0,,PREVIZ  ·  Scene 8: The great flood
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.08,0:03:08.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,The gates of the sky opened with pouring rain, and springs burst from the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.27,0:03:12.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,The ark sailed through waves as big as mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.01,0:03:17.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nuh saw his own son standing apart, and called: O my son, come with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.44,0:03:20.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,But his son said: I will climb a mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.65,0:03:22.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,It will keep me safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.25,0:03:28.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nuh replied: Today nothing can save anyone from Allah's command, except His mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.52,0:03:32.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then a wave came between them, and his son was not saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.87,0:03:35.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mountains and strength cannot save us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.77,0:03:37.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,Only Allah's mercy can.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:39.00,0:03:59.08,Label,,0,0,0,,PREVIZ  ·  Scene 9: Peace returns
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.00,0:03:43.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then it was said: O earth, swallow your water!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.47,0:03:45.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,O sky, hold back your rain!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.51,0:03:50.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,The water went down, and the ark came to rest on Mount Judi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.04,0:03:57.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Allah said: O Nuh, come down in peace from Us, with blessings on you, and on the believers with you.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:59.08,0:04:30.42,Label,,0,0,0,,PREVIZ  ·  Scene 10: The lessons
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.08,0:04:03.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Allah left this story as a sign for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.40,0:04:05.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, will we remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.19,0:04:08.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,What did we learn from Prophet Nuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.17,0:04:12.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,One: never give up doing good, and be patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.09,0:04:15.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Two: be kind to every person, rich or poor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.75,0:04:20.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,Three: trust Allah, even when others laugh at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.01,0:04:25.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's say Nuh's beautiful dua together: Rabbighfir li wa li walidayya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.97,0:04:28.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,My Lord, forgive me and my parents.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.42,0:04:42.67,Label,,0,0,0,,PREVIZ  ·  Scene 11: Outro
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.42,0:04:37.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,This week's Kindness Challenge: be patient with someone, even when it's hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.27,0:04:39.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,See you next time, on Toon Noon!
